% Description: CCSDS-OEM ephemeris propagation -- Spacecraft.EphemerisName points at an OEM file, propagated via Propagator.Type = 'CCSDS-OEM' (no force model). Replace the EphemerisName path with your own OEM file before running.

Create Spacecraft EphSat
EphSat.EphemerisName = '../data/vehicle/ephem/ccsds/SampleOEMEphem.oem'

Create Propagator EphProp
EphProp.Type     = 'CCSDS-OEM'
EphProp.StepSize = 60

Create ReportFile KeplerianElements
KeplerianElements.Filename = 'oem_propagation.txt'
KeplerianElements.Add      = {EphSat.UTCGregorian, EphSat.SMA, EphSat.ECC, EphSat.INC, EphSat.RAAN, EphSat.AOP, EphSat.TA}
KeplerianElements.WriteHeaders = True

BeginMissionSequence

While EphSat.ElapsedDays <= 2
   Propagate EphProp(EphSat)
EndWhile
